o open its\naddressing policy before the team can talk to it.", "originalText": "Register a custom agent with the registration token. A\nnew agent answers only its owner, so open its\naddressing policy before the team can talk to it.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "aS"}, {"id": "el0029", "type": "ellipse", "x": 152.0, "y": 1677.4173913043478, "width": 48.0, "height": 46.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 1541136132, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 896495005, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aT"}, {"id": "el0030", "type": "text", "x": 167.096, "y": 1685.4173913043478, "width": 17.808, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 1170865337, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 925536550, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3", "originalText": "3", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "aU"}, {"id": "el0031", "type": "text", "x": 220.0, "y": 1682.4173913043478, "width": 542.958, "height": 99.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 1571259188, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 166372159, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The agent protocol is one event stream down and\nHTTP operations up. Send the connection's generation\nback with every heartbeat.", "originalText": "The agent protocol is one event stream down and\nHTTP operations up. Send the connection's generation\nback with every heartbeat.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "aV"}, {"id": "el0032", "type": "ellipse", "x": 832.0, "y": 1677.4173913043478, "width": 48.0, "height": 46.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.2, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 340806833, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1682042294, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aW"}, {"id": "el0033", "type": "text", "x": 847.395, "y": 1685.4173913043478, "width": 17.21, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 1673662406, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 889388364, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4", "originalText": "4", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "aX"}, {"id": "el0034", "type": "text", "x": 900.0, "y": 1682.4173913043478, "width": 550.24, "height": 99.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 192187831, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1216388045, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Take the sender's identity from the Switch event, in\ncode. The model chooses actions, and Stageleaf checks\neach one.", "originalText": "Take the sender's identity from the Switch event, in\ncode. The model chooses actions, and Stageleaf checks\neach one.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "aY"}, {"id": "frame0036", "type": "frame", "x": 0.0, "y": 2079.417391304348, "width": 1600.0, "height": 2079.4879686137747, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507251500, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1249750029, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "01 \u00b7 What I built", "index": "aZ"}, {"id": "el0094", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0.0, "y": 2079.417391304348, "width": 1600.0, "height": 2079.4879686137747, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ddd4c2", "backgroundColor": "#fffdf8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0036", "roundness": null, "seed": 507251500, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1249750029, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "aa"}, {"id": "el0037", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 2159.417391304348, "width": 174.546, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0036", "roundness": null, "seed": 375867351, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1501685465, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "01  What I built", "originalText": "01  What I built", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "ab"}, {"id": "el0038", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 2205.417391304348, "width": 1202.798, "height": 62.099999999999994, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0036", "roundness": null, "seed": 842133669, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2144224141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A change on event day, handled in one thread", "originalText": "A change on event day, handled in one thread", "fontSize": 54, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.15, "index": "ac"}, {"id": "el0039", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 2297.5173913043477, "width": 936.406, "height": 66.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0036", "roundness": null, "seed": 934755891, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 449118276, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stageleaf holds an event's run of show, the people and vendors involved, and every published\nversion of the plan. With Switch, the team can change that plan from their chat room.", "originalText": "Stageleaf holds an event's run of show, the people and vendors involved, and every published\nversion of the plan. With Switch, the team can change that plan from their chat room.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "ad"}, {"id": "el0040", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 2383.5173913043477, "width": 651.638, "height": 264.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0036", "roundness": null, "seed": 970541726, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 497372041, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "In the recorded demo, Maya, the keynote speaker, posts in the\nroom: \"I won't get to the venue until about 11:45, so I can't do\nthe 11:15 keynote slot.\" The agent updates Maya's arrival in\nStageleaf and tries two fixes. Moving the keynote to 13:00 would\npush the breakdown past 17:00, when Sam's AV crew leaves.\nSwapping the keynote with the builders' panel keeps every fixed\nsession in place, so the agent proposes the swap and asks the\nthree people whose sessions move.", "originalText": "In the recorded demo, Maya, the keynote speaker, posts in the\nroom: \"I won't get to the venue until about 11:45, so I can't do\nthe 11:15 keynote slot.\" The agent updates Maya's arrival in\nStageleaf and tries two fixes. Moving the keynote to 13:00 would\npush the breakdown past 17:00, when Sam's AV crew leaves.\nSwapping the keynote with the builders' panel keeps every fixed\nsession in place, so the agent proposes the swap and asks the\nthree people whose sessions move.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "ae"}, {"id": "el0041", "type": "text", "x": 830.0, "y": 2383.5173913043477, "width": 638.79, "height": 198.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0036", "roundness": null, "seed": 680715989, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1630721190, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "They answer in the thread. Robin approves too, and the agent\nexplains that Robin's answer isn't needed, because nothing\nRobin owns moves. Once Maya, Sam and Jamie have approved,\nAlex, the lead planner, says to publish. Stageleaf publishes\nversion 2, the agent posts the new run of show to the room, and\neach person affected acknowledges it in the thread.", "originalText": "They answer in the thread. Robin approves too, and the agent\nexplains that Robin's answer isn't needed, because nothing\nRobin owns moves. Once Maya, Sam and Jamie have approved,\nAlex, the lead planner, says to publish. Stageleaf publishes\nversion 2, the agent posts the new run of show to the room, and\neach person affected acknowledges it in the thread.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "af"}, {"id": "el0042", "type": "rectangle", "x": 115.06089536380944, "y": 2724.4734920883047, "width": 940.0, "height": 341.27927927927925, "angle": 6.274458660919614, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#d6cdbb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 55, "groupIds": ["ga2a4aac586"], "frameId": "frame0036", "roundness": null, "seed": 123943672, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 454511103, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "ag"}, {"id": "el0043", "type": "rectangle", "x": 110.0, "y": 2717.5173913043477, "width": 940.0, "height": 341.27927927927925, "angle": 6.274458660919614, "strokeColor": "#d9d3c7", "backgr