ames: [\"stageleaf\"],", "originalText": "  agent_names: [\"stageleaf\"],", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.45, "index": "b2z"}, {"id": "el0248", "type": "text", "x": 1082.0, "y": 7720.405359918122, "width": 339.5, "height": 23.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0214", "roundness": null, "seed": 884598292, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1575276617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "  user_names: [\"alex\", \"sam\", ...] }", "originalText": "  user_names: [\"alex\", \"sam\", ...] }", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.45, "index": "b30"}, {"id": "el0249", "type": "arrow", "x": 1120.0, "y": 7807.605359918122, "width": 20.0, "height": 34.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.8, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0214", "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 1637704315, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1846137938, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0.0, 0.0], [-20.0, -18.0], [-8.0, -34.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false, "index": "b31"}, {"id": "el0250", "type": "text", "x": 1140.0, "y": 7803.605359918122, "width": 275.328, "height": 52.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0214", "roundness": null, "seed": 572900947, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 209038484, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "people are added by their\nMattermost usernames", "originalText": "people are added by their\nMattermost usernames", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.2, "index": "b32"}, {"id": "el0251", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 7916.4053599181225, "width": 651.528, "height": 132.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0214", "roundness": null, "seed": 888186337, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 411479620, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Then create the room. On a Mattermost bridge, create_room\nmakes the channel, adds people by their Mattermost usernames\nand sets the room's instructions in one call. Every agent that joins\nthe room gets those instructions from connect_to_room.", "originalText": "Then create the room. On a Mattermost bridge, create_room\nmakes the channel, adds people by their Mattermost usernames\nand sets the room's instructions in one call. Every agent that joins\nthe room gets those instructions from connect_to_room.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b33"}, {"id": "el0252", "type": "text", "x": 830.0, "y": 7916.4053599181225, "width": 626.448, "height": 99.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0214", "roundness": null, "seed": 1282596590, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 803941588, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "In the repo, npm run demo:setup does all of this. It also creates\nthe demo team's Mattermost accounts and links the room to a\nsample event in Stageleaf.", "originalText": "In the repo, npm run demo:setup does all of this. It also creates\nthe demo team's Mattermost accounts and links the room to a\nsample event in Stageleaf.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b34"}, {"id": "frame0254", "type": "frame", "x": 0.0, "y": 8288.405359918122, "width": 1600.0, "height": 1609.1000000000004, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1150287824, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1540944426, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "05 \u00b7 The agent protocol", "index": "b35"}, {"id": "el0297", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0.0, "y": 8288.405359918122, "width": 1600.0, "height": 1609.1000000000004, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ddd4c2", "backgroundColor": "#fffdf8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0254", "roundness": null, "seed": 1150287824, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1540944426, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b36"}, {"id": "el0255", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 8368.405359918122, "width": 257.66200000000003, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0254", "roundness": null, "seed": 907158353, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1696006815, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "05  The agent protocol", "originalText": "05  The agent protocol", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "b37"}, {"id": "el0256", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 8414.405359918122, "width": 1193.834, "height": 62.099999999999994, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0254", "roundness": null, "seed": 1924681379, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1757705248, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "One event stream down, HTTP operations up", "originalText": "One event stream down, HTTP operations up", "fontSize": 54, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.15, "index": "b38"}, {"id": "el0257", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 8506.505359918123, "width": 647.26, "height": 132.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0254", "roundness": null, "seed": 531597231, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 851851325, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Switch Console can connect coding agents such as Claude Code,\nCodex and OpenCode to a room. I wanted an agent with its own\ntools and rules, so I wrote a client for the agent protocol in Node.\nIt is 262 lines, in agent/switch-client.mjs.", "originalText": "Switch Console can connect coding agents such as Claude Code,\nCodex and OpenCode to a room. I wanted an agent with its own\ntools and rules, so I wrote a client for the agent protocol in Node.\nIt is 262 lines, in agent/switch-client.mjs.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b39"}, {"id": "el0258", "type": "text", "x": 830.0, "y": 8506.505359918123, "width": 630.32, "height": 231.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0254", "roundness": null, "seed": 1833187743, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 174741373, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The agent opens one server-sent event stream and keeps it\nopen. The first event, connection_state, carries the heartbeat\ninterval and a generation number. Message events follow, each\nwith the sender's username, the text, the message id and the\nthread id. Everything the agent does goes the other way as an\nHTTP operation, such as connect_to_room, read_context,\npost_message and update_room_document.", "originalText": "The agent opens one server-sent event stream and keeps it\nopen. The first event, connection_state, carries the heartbeat\ninterval and a generation number. Message events follow, each\nwith the sender's username, the text, the message id and the\nthread id. Everything the agent does goes the other way as an\nHTTP operation, such as connect_to_room, read_context,\npost_message and update_room_document.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b3A"}, {"id": "el0259", "type": "rectangle", "x": 110.0, "y": 8797.505359918123, "width": 280.0, "height": 84.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f6b57", 