"transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0254", "roundness": null, "seed": 81703679, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1533125533, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0.0, 0.0], [60.0, 0.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "index": "b3j"}, {"id": "el0294", "type": "text", "x": 742.0, "y": 9523.505359918123, "width": 327.508, "height": 23.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f6b57", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0254", "roundness": null, "seed": 598390551, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1072274007, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "operations from the agent (HTTP)", "originalText": "operations from the agent (HTTP)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "b3k"}, {"id": "el0295", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 9609.505359918123, "width": 639.846, "height": 165.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0254", "roundness": null, "seed": 1092740512, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1046723213, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "When the client declares protocol 6, each heartbeat has to carry\nthat generation number. Without it, Switch answers 409\nunfenced, the heartbeats stop counting and the server evicts the\nconnection after 6 seconds. My client reconnected, was evicted\nagain and kept looping until I added the field.", "originalText": "When the client declares protocol 6, each heartbeat has to carry\nthat generation number. Without it, Switch answers 409\nunfenced, the heartbeats stop counting and the server evicts the\nconnection after 6 seconds. My client reconnected, was evicted\nagain and kept looping until I added the field.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b3l"}, {"id": "el0296", "type": "text", "x": 830.0, "y": 9609.505359918123, "width": 649.592, "height": 198.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0254", "roundness": null, "seed": 1845339622, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1602728742, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "post_message posts into the room your connection is in, so call\nconnect_to_room first. If one agent serves several rooms, handle\none message at a time, or a reply can land in the wrong room. On\nreconnect the client sends Last-Event-ID, and it saves the ids of\nthe messages it has answered, so a restart catches up without\nanswering twice.", "originalText": "post_message posts into the room your connection is in, so call\nconnect_to_room first. If one agent serves several rooms, handle\none message at a time, or a reply can land in the wrong room. On\nreconnect the client sends Last-Event-ID, and it saves the ids of\nthe messages it has answered, so a restart catches up without\nanswering twice.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b3m"}, {"id": "frame0298", "type": "frame", "x": 0.0, "y": 10047.505359918123, "width": 1600.0, "height": 1261.4548387096784, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1850834287, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 536887397, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "06 \u00b7 Who decides", "index": "b3n"}, {"id": "el0340", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0.0, "y": 10047.505359918123, "width": 1600.0, "height": 1261.4548387096784, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ddd4c2", "backgroundColor": "#fffdf8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": null, "seed": 1850834287, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 536887397, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b3o"}, {"id": "el0299", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 10127.505359918123, "width": 178.704, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": null, "seed": 787818319, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1885335595, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "06  Who decides", "originalText": "06  Who decides", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "b3p"}, {"id": "el0300", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 10173.505359918123, "width": 1272.134, "height": 62.099999999999994, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": null, "seed": 1875034268, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 999121279, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The sender's name comes from the Switch event", "originalText": "The sender's name comes from the Switch event", "fontSize": 54, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.15, "index": "b3q"}, {"id": "el0301", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 10265.605359918123, "width": 1074.786, "height": 66.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": null, "seed": 259063754, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 843975411, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "An approval should come from the person who owns the decision. If the model could write \"Sam approved\",\nany message could approve anything.", "originalText": "An approval should come from the person who owns the decision. If the model could write \"Sam approved\",\nany message could approve anything.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b3r"}, {"id": "el0302", "type": "text", "x": 110.0, "y": 10351.605359918123, "width": 634.5, "height": 198.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": null, "seed": 1025173774, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 980738884, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "So the agent's code builds the evidence for each message from\nthe Switch event: the room id, the message id and the sender's\nMattermost username. Every tool that acts for a person, such as\nrecord_decision, record_acknowledgment and publish_revision,\ngets that evidence from code. The tools have no field for who is\nacting, so the model has nothing to fill in.", "originalText": "So the agent's code builds the evidence for each message from\nthe Switch event: the room id, the message id and the sender's\nMattermost username. Every tool that acts for a person, such as\nrecord_decision, record_acknowledgment and publish_revision,\ngets that evidence from code. The tools have no field for who is\nacting, so the model has nothing to fill in.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b3s"}, {"id": "el0303", "type": "text", "x": 830.0, "y": 10351.605359918123, "width": 646.6, "height": 231.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": null, "seed": 621157093, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 193674903, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stageleaf then checks the action. The room has to be the one\nlinked to the event, the username has to belong to someone who\nowns an affected session, and only the lead planner can publish.\nA refusal goes back to the model as a tool error, and the model\nexplains it in the thread, as it did for Robin. A test covers the\nsame case: a scripted model tries to record Sam's approval while\nRobin is talking, and Stageleaf records nothing.", "originalText": "Stageleaf then checks the action. The room has to be the one\nlinked to the event, the username has to belong to someone who\nowns an affected session, and only the lead planner can publish.\nA refusal goes back to the model as a tool error, and the model\nexplains it in the thread, as it did for Robin. A test covers the\nsame case: a scripted model tries to record Sam's approval while\nRobin is talking, and Stageleaf records nothing.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b3t"}, {"id": "el0304", "type": "rectangle", "x": 115.0, "y": 10659.605359918123, "width": 300.0, "height": 190.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#d9d1c0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 45, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 263107568, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 365627821, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b3u"}, {"id": "el0305", "type": "rectangle", "x": 110.0, "y": 10652.605359918123, "width": 300.0, "height": 190.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1006702667, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1119917742, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b3v"}, {"id": "el0306", "type": "text", "x": 130.0, "y": 10666.605359918123, "width": 164.786, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": null, "seed": 793074197, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1047025580, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Switch event", "originalText": "Switch event", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "b3w"}, {"id": "el0307", "type": "text", "x": 130.0, "y": 10712.605359918123, "width": 189.5, "height": 69.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": null, "seed": 1522257886, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1351427064, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "sender_name: \"robin\"\nbody: \"Approve from\nme too\"", "originalText": "sender_name: \"robin\"\nbody: \"Approve from\nme too\"", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.45, "index": "b3x"}, {"id": "el0308", "type": "arrow", "x": 418.0, "y": 10747.605359918123, "width": 44.0, "height": 0.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": null, "seed": 1111667947, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 482047586, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0.0, 0.0], [44.0, 0.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false, "index": "b3y"}, {"id": "el0309", "type": "rectangle", "x": 475.0, "y": 10659.605359918123, "width": 300.0, "height": 190.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#d9d1c0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 45, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0298", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 141862884, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2001057849, "isDeleted": fa