r": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0341", "roundness": null, "seed": 947301866, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 900274542, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stageleaf knows the venue hours, which sessions are fixed,\nwhich rooms overlap and when each person is available. The\nagent runs candidate plans through a preview_change tool\nbefore it proposes one. Its message could say \"That pushes\nBreakdown to 17:30, but Sam's crew leaves at 17:00\" because a\ncheck returned that fact.", "originalText": "Stageleaf knows the venue hours, which sessions are fixed,\nwhich rooms overlap and when each person is available. The\nagent runs candidate plans through a preview_change tool\nbefore it proposes one. Its message could say \"That pushes\nBreakdown to 17:30, but Sam's crew leaves at 17:00\" because a\ncheck returned that fact.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b4Y"}, {"id": "el0345", "type": "text", "x": 830.0, "y": 11677.060198627802, "width": 645.412, "height": 99.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0341", "roundness": null, "seed": 669119748, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1874428881, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "When the answer isn't in Stageleaf, such as whether the\npanelists can come earlier, the agent asks the person who would\nknow.", "originalText": "When the answer isn't in Stageleaf, such as whether the\npanelists can come earlier, the agent asks the person who would\nknow.", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.5, "index": "b4Z"}, {"id": "el0346", "type": "text", "x": 338.20900000000023, "y": 11945.060198627802, "width": 43.582, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#7b8088", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0341", "roundness": null, "seed": 255468868, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1279065700, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "11:00", "originalText": "11:00", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "index": "b4a"}, {"id": "el0347", "type": "line", "x": 360.0000000000002, "y": 11973.060198627802, "width": 0.0, "height": 12.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#7b8088", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0.4, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0341", "roundness": null, "seed": 472405074, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 735234538, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0.0, 0.0], [0.0, 12.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "index": "b4b"}, {"id": "el0348", "type": "text", "x": 503.2959074074072, "y": 11945.060198627802, "width": 48.223, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#7b8088", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "frame0341", "roundness": null, "seed": 2001978741, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1051387350, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793980800000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text":